@startuml
title WP-004 Domain Overview

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package "External Actors" {
    class Application
    class Framework
    class Runtime
    class Bootstrap
    class Lifecycle
    class ServiceProvider
}

package "Container Aggregate" {
    class Container <<Aggregate Root>>
    class Binding <<Entity>>
    class Alias <<Entity>>
    class ServiceIdentifier <<Value Object>>
    class BindingType <<Value Object>>
    class Lifetime <<Value Object>>
    class BindingMetadata <<Value Object>>
    class ResolutionContext <<Value Object>>
    class ResolutionPath <<Value Object>>
    class ResolutionPolicy <<Value Object>>
}

package "Domain Services" {
    class ResolutionEngine <<Domain Service>>
    class BindingValidator <<Domain Service>>
    class AliasResolver <<Domain Service>>
    class FactoryResolver <<Domain Service>>
}

Application "1" *-- "1" Container : owns
Framework --> Application : creates
Bootstrap --> Application : constructs
Lifecycle --> Application : coordinates
ServiceProvider --> Application : registers through
Runtime <-- Application : exposes

Container "1" *-- "*" Binding : contains
Container "1" *-- "*" Alias : contains
Binding --> ServiceIdentifier : identified by
Binding --> BindingType : classified by
Binding --> Lifetime : governed by
Binding --> BindingMetadata : described by
Alias --> ServiceIdentifier : references
ResolutionContext --> ResolutionPath : owns
ResolutionContext --> ResolutionPolicy : follows

Container --> BindingValidator : validates with
Container --> AliasResolver : resolves aliases with
Container --> ResolutionEngine : resolves services with
ResolutionEngine --> FactoryResolver : delegates factory creation

note bottom of Container
The Container is the only Aggregate Root.
Infrastructure repositories and caches are outside the domain model.
end note

@enduml
